--- OLD
      LDA tmp+11
      CLC
      ADC #2
      STA tmp+11           ; increment the visible scanlines by 2 (box grows 2 pixels/frame)
--- NEW
      LDA tmp+11           ; grow the box by the step size -- 2 normally, 11
      CLC                  ;  with Speed Hacks.  The loop below compares with
      ADC OPTD_DLGOPEN     ;  BCC rather than for equality, so the step does
      STA tmp+11           ;  not have to divide the 88 lines it covers.
